WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Later, daddy will steam the big crab with you in it

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,160
Eat it directly into your stomach

3
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:08,750
Let’s see if he dares to catch fish in the future

4
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:11,160
of course true

5
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:21,170
Watch him for me for a while so I can get my revenge.

6
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:23,780
You also eat the boss

7
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:25,260
Is this expensive?

8
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:26,620
No matter how expensive it is, it’s still for eating.

9
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:31,760
You're welcome

10
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:39,500
The taste is really worth the price

11
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,100
New top quality king crab only with wine for NT$5,000 each
